          "AffiliationInfo": {"Affiliation": "Norma Kiser-Larson, PhD, RN, is an associate professor of nursing at North Dakota State University, Fargo, North Dakota. She is a member of First Assembly of God Church, Fargo, North Dakota. She is actively involved in prayer ministry, jail/prison ministry, and missions."}
        }
